<title>USA: Baxter International Inc Q1 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Baxter International Inc Q1 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.55		    $0.51</p>
<p> Oper net		  150,000		  138,000</p>
<p> Revs		    1,443,000		1,299,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  274,000		  272,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net and EPS exclude one-time acquired in-process R&amp;D charge of $352 million, or $1.29/shr, on acquisitions of Immuno International ($220 million) and Research Medical Inc ($132 million).</p>
<p>1996 Q1 net and EPS exclude income from discontinued operations of $20 million, or $0.07/shr.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
